      },
      {
        "text": "Beside ant nest Immortal Gu is rank seven Letter Seal, an information path Immortal Gu. Letter seal Immortal Gu holds a large amount of contents regarding army ants and had been used to seal ant nest Immortal Gu. Because a rank eight Immortal Gu must be fed in time or it dies of hunger, Wu Shuai used letter seal Immortal Gu to cover ant nest Immortal Gu with a thick layer of rock membrane, creating an Immortal Gu rock, leaving letter seal Immortal Gu inside as the price. When the clone dissects the rock, ant nest Gu is still alive after so many years, though ant nest Immortal Gu is extremely weak and hungry. Fang Yuan had already prepared the food. Wu Shuai feeds the Immortal Gu. For ant nest Immortal Gu to create army ants, immortal essence is only one of the conditions. It still requires specific immortal materials.",
