  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the depths of Eastern Sea, at Gu tribe headquarters, Fang Yuan’s dragonman clone Wu Shuai unlocks a seal the original Wu Shuai arranged as a preserved inheritance. He stores a large grey rock in his immortal aperture and dissects it with the correct method, revealing two Immortal Gu. Immortal Gu Ant Nest, rank eight, looks like an ordinary inverted bowl, brown, with a rough appearance. It was the core Immortal Gu of Green Ant Ascetic. This Gu can breed all kinds of army ants. Army ant is a species created by Green Ant Ascetic, extremely suitable for enslavement path Gu Immortals, and the real Wu Shuai’s most used method. The queen ant of army ants can breed other ants but cannot breed another queen ant.",
        "chapters": [
          1862
        ],
